  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4df0014cb02a0cf4bbbc7addabd2224a, type: 3}
  m_Name: MainDialogueNPCInstance3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Well, shit. You actually made it.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Imma be honest with you fam, I did NOT expect to see you alive here.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Yes yes I'm so cruel what a cruel pig what a cruel world yada yada.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: 'Now come on, pass me those mushroooooommmmmmsssssss. '
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Here have this as a thank you.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Now, I have one last favour to ask of you.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Awww come on, don't gimme that look, we're practically brothers at this
      point!
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: So, here, you're gonna open the shop, buy stuff to your hearts content,
      then go to that not-suspicious-at-all-cave over there, ok? Imma meet you there.
